tan({x}^{3})) \\\\  & =arctan({x}^{3})\\cdot \\frac{1}{{x}^{2}+1}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({x}^{2}+1)+\\operatorname{ln}⁡({x}^{2}+1)\\cdot \\frac{1}{1+({x}^{3})^{2}}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({x}^{3}) \\\\  & =arctan({x}^{3})\\cdot \\frac{1}{{x}^{2}+1}\\cdot 2x+\\operatorname{ln}⁡({x}^{2}+1)\\cdot \\frac{1}{1+({x}^{3})^{2}}\\cdot 3{x}^{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{2xarctan({x}^{3})}{{x}^{2}+1}+\\frac{3{x}^{2}\\operatorname{ln}⁡({x}^{2}+1)}{1+{x}^{6}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534370 true] [17592186284526 1000 #edb/ref 17592186284527 13194139534370 true] [17592186284526 1000 #edb/ref 17592186284528 13194139534370 true] [17592186284526 1000 #edb/ref 17592186284529 13194139534370 true] [17592186284526 1000 #edb/ref 17592186284530 13194139534370 true] [17592186284526 1000 #edb/ref 17592186284531 13194139534370 true] [17592186284526 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534370 true] [17592186284526 1041 "selection" 13194139534370 true] [17592186284526 1104 #edb/ref 17592186284529 13194139534370 true] [17592186284526 1110 #uuid "b55ddaba-5cbd-513d-955b-9baf4aad608c" 13194139534370 true] [17592186284527 1034 "\\frac{2x}{{x}^{2}+1}-\\frac{3{x}^{2}}{1+{x}^{6}}" 13194139534370 true] [17592186284527 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534370 true] [17592186284527 1111 #uuid "f3d85ee9-70f3-5ded-9be5-112704718cd5" 13194139534370 true] [17592186284528 1034 "\\frac{arctan({x}^{3})}{{x}^{2}+1}-\\frac{{x}^{3}\\operatorname{ln}⁡({x}^{2}+1)}{1+{x}^{6}}" 13194139534370 true] [17592186284528 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534370 true] [17592186284528 1111 #uuid "00943ce5-3863-5187-9158-2d9b50815715" 13194139534370 true] [17592186284529 1034 "\\frac{2xarctan({x}^{3})}{{x}^{2}+1}+\\frac{3{x}^{2}\\operatorname{ln}⁡({x}^{2}+1)}{1+{x}^{6}}" 13194139534370 true] [17592186284529 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534370 true] [17592186284529 1111 #uuid "7cbaae8a-a739-51ad-a619-8a3dbff351d0" 13194139534370 true] [17592186284530 1034 "\\frac{2x}{{x}^{2}+1}+\\frac{3{x}^{2}}{1+{x}^{6}}" 13194139534370 true] [17592186284530 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534370 true] [17592186284530 1111 #uuid "de9b7cc8-dd4b-58e8-8010-a23d5a4899e9" 13194139534370 true] [17592186284531 1034 "\\frac{2xarctan({x}^{3})}{{x}^{6}+1}+\\frac{3{x}^{2}\\operatorname{ln}⁡({x}^{2}+1)}{1+{x}^{2}}" 13194139534370 true] [17592186284531 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534370 true] [17592186284531 1111 #uuid "098bd745-4a5c-55aa-abd0-00d2f764b2fe" 13194139534370 true] [17592186284532 1017 #edb/ref 17592186284533 13194139534370 true] [17592186284532 1089 "q-31823" 13194139534370 true] [17592186284532 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139534370 true] [17592186284532 1100 "Find the slope of the tangent line to the curve $f(x)=6\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(3{x}^{2}-2x)$ at $x=1.$" 13194139534370 true] [17592186284532 1113 #uuid "ee97d5f5-6a9c-51cc-a159-6877c0bdbc98" 13194139534370 true] [17592186284532 1145 "The formula for the derivative of arctangent is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arctan}⁡x)=\\frac{1}{1+{x}^{2}}.\n$$\n\nUsing the chain rule and the formula above, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}[6\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(3{x}^{2}-2x)] \\\\  & =6\\cdot \\frac{1}{1+(3{x}^{2}-2x)^{2}}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(3{x}^{2}-2x) \\\\  & =\\frac{6}{1+9{x}^{4}-12{x}^{3}+4{x}^{2}}\\cdot (6x-2) \\\\  & =\\frac{36x-12}{9{x}^{4}-12{x}^{3}+4{x}^{2}+1}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the slope of the tangent line to the curve $y=f(x)$ at $x=1$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(1) & =\\frac{36(1)-12}{9({1}^{4})-12({1}^{3})+4({1}^{2})+1} \\\\  & =\\frac{24}{2} \\\\  & =12.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534370 true] [17592186284533 1000 #edb/ref 17592186284534 13194139534370 true] [17592186284533 1000 #edb/ref 17592186284535 13194139534370 true] [17592186284533 1000 #edb/ref 17592186284536 13194139534370 true] [17592186284533 1000 #edb/ref 17592186284537 13194139534370 true] [17592186284533 1000 #edb/ref 1759218628453