\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}[2\\operatorname{arccos}⁡(1+x)] \\\\  & =2(-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-(1+x)^{2}}})\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(1+x) \\\\  & =-\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{1-(1+2x+{x}^{2})}} \\\\  & =-\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{-2x-{x}^{2}}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the slope $m$ of the tangent line to the curve at $x=-1$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}m & ={\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{x=-1} \\\\  & =-\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{-2(-1)-(-1)^{2}}} \\\\  & =-2.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534370 true] [17592186284540 1000 #edb/ref 17592186284541 13194139534370 true] [17592186284540 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534370 true] [17592186284540 1041 "field-1" 13194139534370 true] [17592186284540 1104 #edb/ref 17592186284541 13194139534370 true] [17592186284540 1110 #uuid "fab3d06a-c4b1-5aff-9f76-08957e539130" 13194139534370 true] [17592186284541 1034 "-2" 13194139534370 true] [17592186284541 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534370 true] [17592186284541 1111 #uuid "44368fd2-8fb5-51de-afaa-de8a0194a267" 13194139534370 true] [17592186284542 1017 #edb/ref 17592186284543 13194139534370 true] [17592186284542 1089 "q-73510" 13194139534370 true] [17592186284542 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139534370 true] [17592186284542 1100 "Calculate $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}$ for $y=\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\operatorname{arccos}⁡(5-x).$" 13194139534370 true] [17592186284542 1113 #uuid "53683620-aae1-5c2f-ad8b-d772436a9136" 13194139534370 true] [17592186284542 1145 "Applying the product rule, using the formula for the derivative of $\\operatorname{arccos}⁡x$ and applying the chain rule, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\operatorname{arccos}⁡(5-x)) & =\\operatorname{arccos}⁡(5-x)\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡x)+\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arccos}⁡(5-x)) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{arccos}⁡(5-x)\\cdot (-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x)+\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\